request.description:
Programmatic search entrypoint. Returns JSON: `{query, results: [{url, title, content, engine, ...}], answers, corrections, infoboxes, suggestions, unresponsive_engines}` (current releases no longer send `number_of_results`). This is the exact URL shape Open WebUI hits (`SEARXNG_QUERY_URL=http://searxng:8080/search?q=<query>&format=json`) — see SEARXNG.md § Wiring into Open WebUI.

Fan-out: every call spawns fresh requests to all enabled upstream engines (google, bing, wikipedia, etc. from the upstream default set via `use_default_settings: true` — `duckduckgo` is disabled, see the collection description). Latency is dominated by the slowest engine, bounded by `outgoing.max_request_timeout` (10.0s) in settings.yml. If `results` is empty, upstream engines all failed — check `make logs searxng` and inspect `unresponsive_engines`.

Rate limit: none, because `server.limiter: false` in settings.yml. Public egress IP may still get rate-limited by Google/Bing themselves — that surfaces as engines dropping into `unresponsive_engines`, not as a 429 from SearXNG.

#### Schemas

With `format=json` (allowed by `search.formats` in settings.yml; a format not listed there is a 403); without it the HTML results page. `q` is required: none is a 400. Open WebUI reads `results[].url`, `title` and `content`.

Response `200` (`application/json`):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": [
    "query",
    "results",
    "answers",
    "corrections",
    "infoboxes",
    "suggestions",
    "unresponsive_engines"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "query": {"type": "string"},
    "results": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "A MainResult (or a legacy dict result) as `as_dict()` gives it",
        "required": ["url", "title", "content", "engine"],
        "properties": {
          "url": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
          "title": {"type": "string"},
          "content": {"type": "string", "description": "The snippet"},
          "engine": {"type": "string", "description": "The engine that returned it first"},
          "engines": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "string"},
            "description": "Every engine that returned it"
          },
          "score": {"type": "number", "description": "The merged rank; `results` is sorted by it"},
          "category": {"type": "string"},
          "publishedDate": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "description": "ISO 8601, when the engine gives one"
          },
          "thumbnail": {"type": "string"},
          "img_src": {"type": "string"},
          "template": {"type": "string", "description": "`default.html`, `images.html`, …"},
          "parsed_url": {
            "type": ["array", "null"],
            "items": {"type": "string"},
            "description": "urllib's six parts"
          },
          "positions": {"description": "Its position in each engine's list"}
        }
      }
    },
    "answers": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true}
    },
    "corrections": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {"type": "string"}
    },
    "infoboxes": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true}
    },
    "suggestions": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {"type": "string"}
    },
    "unresponsive_engines": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Engines that failed or timed out (`outgoing.max_request_timeout`), sorted",
      "items": {
        "type": "array",
        "prefixItems": [
          {"type": "string", "description": "The engine"},
          {"type": "string", "description": "Why, translated (`Suspended: …` when suspended)"}
        ],
        "minItems": 2,
        "maxItems": 2
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Response `400` (`application/json`) — no `q` (`No query`), or a bad parameter:

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": ["error"],
  "properties": {
    "error": {"type": "string"}
  }
}
```

Response `500` (`application/json`) — `search error`:

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": ["error"],
  "properties": {
    "error": {"type": "string"}
  }
}
```

Deployment introspection. Returns JSON describing the running instance's configuration: every engine (its categories, shortcut, timeout and `enabled` flag), the categories, plugins, safe_search level, default locale, autocomplete backend, limiter state, version and brand info. Useful to confirm the settings.yml overrides loaded — `duckduckgo` shows `enabled: false` and `limiter.enabled` false. It does NOT report `search.formats`: check JSON output with `/search?q=…&format=json` instead (a format not listed there answers 403).

Exposed by default upstream and not disabled in ai/searxng/settings.yml. Read-only, no side effects.

#### Schemas

The running instance's settings. It does not list `search.formats`.

Response `200` (`application/json`):

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": ["categories", "engines", "plugins", "version"],
  "properties": {
    "categories": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {"type": "string"}
    },
    "engines": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "required": ["name", "categories", "enabled"],
        "properties": {
          "name": {"type": "string"},
          "categories": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "string"}
          },
          "shortcut": {"type": "string"},
          "enabled": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "false for `duckduckgo` here (settings.yml)"
          },
          "paging": {"type": "boolean"},
          "language_support": {"type": "boolean"},
          "safesearch": {"type": "boolean"},
          "time_range_support": {"type": "boolean"},
          "timeout": {"type": ["number", "null"]}
        }
      }
    },
    "plugins": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "properties": {
          "name": {"type": "string"},
          "enabled": {"type": "boolean"}
        }
      }
    },
    "instance_name": {"type": "string"},
    "default_locale": {"type": "string"},
    "autocomplete": {"type": "string"},
    "safe_search": {"type": "integer"},
    "default_theme": {"type": "string"},
    "version": {"type": "string"},
    "limiter": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "properties": {
        "enabled": {"type": "boolean", "description": "false here (`server.limiter`)"}
      }
    },
    "public_instance": {"type": "boolean"}
  }
}
```
